{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2021-06-04 10:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES TO WEBCAST ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS', 'text': 'FORT WORTH, TEXAS, JUNE 04, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP (NASDAQ: AAL) WILL CONDUCT A LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST OF THE FORMAL BUSINESS OF ITS VIRTUAL ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS WEDNESDAY, JUNE 9, AT 9 A.M. CT. THE WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC ON A LISTEN-ONLY BASIS AT AA.COM/INVESTORRELATIONS, AND AN ARCHIVE OF THE WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE AFTERWARD.'}